S5-07 bounded delay_tsc call-summary exact-nonce replays — 2026-11-17

Purpose
-------
This diagnostic followed the schema-v14 per-RIP attribution that localized
+10,402 CPL0 RDTSC reads to `delay_tsc+0x4d` and +11 reads to
`delay_tsc+0x1b`. It tests whether the delta comes from additional calls or
different polling lengths. The opt-in schema-v15 capture does not change guest
semantics, the comparator, or normalization rules.

Inputs and invocation
---------------------
Both 3,000,000,000-instruction direct runs were executed sequentially with the
release `od-runner` on Mac ARM64. They used the same Stage4A/CPL0/user-mode
profile as the counted canonical source runs, RAM 128 MiB, and no diagnostic
randomization flags. Exact per-run nonces:

* run 0001: `OD518e8be9ac44221a00000fb3400000000`
* run 0002: `OD518e8bfb13a39d1980000fb3400000001`

Input SHA-256 values, verified before execution and again in runner metadata:

