|---|---|
| kernel `vmlinuz-7.0.0-38-generic` | `9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e` |
| initramfs | `ee9183a4eded3c16a8c6a7a81c6d5bb79be8bb023f793f7cd61694ea2bd3e588` |
